{"record_id":"tr-114-l3-public-fact-process-repair","record_kind":"production","version":"1","layers":["L3"],"source_form":{"text":"流程越完整，事件就越容易变成公共事实；但流程的每一环若都由同一权力控制，事实也越容易变成权力对自己的回声。","language_tag":"zh-Hans","form_status":"task_113_historical_accepted_text"},"source_language_profile":"zh-hans-modern-written-r1","normalized_meaning_candidate":{"candidate_id":"mc-114-discourse-01","text":"Reporting and circulation can make an event publicly visible, but a single controller can bias what returns as public fact; neither relation is deterministic.","status":"CANDIDATE_PROJECTION_NOT_NEUTRAL_MEANING"},"target_form":{"text":"一件事经过报告、登记、解释和传播，才可能进入公共视野。流程能让事实被看见；可若每一环都握在同一权力手里，返回中心的事实就会越来越像权力自己的回声。","language_tag":"zh-Hans","form_status":"task_114_current_revision"},"target_language_profile":"zh-hans-modern-written-r1","source_frame":{"d06":"paired_more_more_construction_suggests_monotonic_relations","d08":"abstract_flow_first; event_and_visibility_compressed"},"target_frame":{"d06":"possibility_then_bounded_contrast; controller_condition_explicit","d08":"event_traverses_steps_then_visibility_then_control_risk"},"framing_deltas":[{"dimension_id":"d06","delta_type":"deterministic_sounding_link_bounded","source_value":"paired_more_more_construction_suggests_monotonic_relations","target_value":"possibility_then_bounded_contrast; controller_condition_explicit","epistemic_relevance":true,"disposition":"corrected","justification":"The revised connective logic matches the essay's explicitly bounded mechanism claim."},{"dimension_id":"d08","delta_type":"event_process_before_abstraction","source_value":"abstract_flow_first; event_and_visibility_compressed","target_value":"event_traverses_steps_then_visibility_then_control_risk","epistemic_relevance":false,"disposition":"human_adjudicated_and_accepted","justification":"Information order makes the process observable before naming its political risk."}],"unmapped_residue":[],"claim_ceiling":"mechanism analogy remains bounded; no de